      <p>UK pensions keep increasing in Spain. That's a huge advantage compared to countries like Canada or Australia where pensions freeze. The Brexit Withdrawal Agreement ensures your UK state pension rises with inflation every year. Here's how UK pensions work in Spain.</p>
